  "description": "Managed C# rendering/font services for Avalonia 12.1.5. Windows/Linux/macOS installed-font discovery. Add SimdSkia.Avalonia.Desktop for OS window hosts and SimdSkia.Avalonia.Gpu for optional hardware drawing. Incomplete compatibility.",
